  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN JOINT PROGRAMME SOCIAL PROTECTION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is that by 2025, the implementation and sustainability of the National Basic Social Security Strategy ENSSB II is strengthened with focus on increasing efficiency, reliability of data, and supporting programme implementation with stronger cash plus approaches. Direct support to the UNJP-SP will also allow Ireland to be part of the Development Partner Working Group on advancing the Child Grant, and supports for improved child nutrition and presents an opportunity for Ireland to make a significant contribution to the development of SP in Mozambique and progress the SDGs.</narrative>
  </description>
